{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"CUDA 算子工程：手写 FlashAttention v2 之路","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">created</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 2026<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>07<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>14 21<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">43</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">updated</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 2026<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>07<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>14 21<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">43</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">aliases</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> 第17章：TMA<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>Warp<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>Specialization<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>把<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>FA2<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>写到<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>SOTA\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 第17章：TMA<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>Warp<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>Specialization<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>把<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>FA2<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>写到<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>SOTA\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">source</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> https<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>//www.yangyitao.com/books/cuda/chapters/17<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>tma<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>warp<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>specialization\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> gpu<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>computing\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> CUDA\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> 系列教程\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> AI\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">category</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> GPU计算/CUDA\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">cssclasses</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> gpu<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>computing\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> series\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">note</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean important\">true</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">series</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> CUDA 算子工程：手写 FlashAttention v2 之路</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<div data-callout-metadata=\"\" data-callout-fold=\"\" data-callout=\"info\" class=\"callout drop-shadow\"><div class=\"callout-title\" dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"callout-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-info\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"callout-title-inner\">文档定位</div></div><div class=\"callout-content ab-note\">\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>AI 整理 + 学习笔记</strong>。原文出自杨艺韬《CUDA 算子工程：手写 FlashAttention v2 之路》一书。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">原文链接:<a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.yangyitao.com/books/cuda/chapters/17-tma-warp-specialization\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.yangyitao.com/books/cuda/chapters/17-tma-warp-specialization</a><br>\n系列入口:<a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/CUDA%20%E7%AE%97%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%8B%E5%86%99%20FlashAttention%20v2%20%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF/README/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/CUDA%20%E7%AE%97%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%8B%E5%86%99%20FlashAttention%20v2%20%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF/README/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">大模型/CUDA 算子工程：手写 FlashAttention v2 之路/README</a></p>\n</div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">CUDA 算子工程：手写 FlashAttention v2 之路</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\"Hopper is not Ampere with a faster Tensor Core. It is a different programming model — and FlashAttention v3 is the first proof that the new model genuinely matters.\"<br>\n——FA3 论文社区评论中的常见判断</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"为什么 Hopper 上的写法不一样\" dir=\"auto\">为什么 Hopper 上的写法不一样</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">第 15 章我们写的 FA2 forward 用的是 Ampere 时代的工具：<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">cp.async</code>异步拷贝 + <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">mma.sync.m16n8k16</code>矩阵乘。这套工具在 H100 上还能用，但只能跑到 ~530 TFLOPs（54% Tensor Core 峰值）。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">如果换成 Hopper 原生工具：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>TMA</strong>替代 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">cp.async</code></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>WGMMA</strong>替代 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">mma.sync</code></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Warp Specialization</strong>替代对称 warp</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">性能能从 ~530 TFLOPs 提升到 <strong>~740 TFLOPs（FP16）</strong>或 <strong>~1200 TFLOPs（FP8）</strong>。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">数据来源：Shah et al., <em>FlashAttention-3</em>, 2024.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">为什么差距这么大？三个原因：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>TMA 比 cp.async 更高效</strong>：单线程发起、专用硬件、原生 swizzle、不占 SIMT 算术单元。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>WGMMA 是异步指令</strong>：发完不阻塞，warp 可以继续算/拷下一份。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Warp Specialization 把\"算\"和\"拷\"真正分离</strong>：Producer 永远在拷，Consumer 永远在算，硬件流水拉满。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"Producer / Consumer 的角色分配\" dir=\"auto\">Producer / Consumer 的角色分配</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">FA2 在 Hopper 上的核心 idea 是把 4 个 warp（128 thread）拆成两类：</p>\n<div class=\"mermaid\"><svg id=\"m3f71bf64baea6dc9\" width=\"351\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" class=\"flowchart\" height=\"778\" viewBox=\"0 0 351 778\" role=\"graphics-document document\" aria-roledescription=\"flowchart-v2\"><style>#m3f71bf64baea6dc9{font-family:var(--font-mermaid);font-size:16px;fill:#333;}@keyframes edge-animation-frame{from{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}@keyframes dash{to{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}#m3f71bf64baea6dc9 .edge-animation-slow{stroke-dasharray:9,5!important;stroke-dashoffset:900;animation:dash 50s linear infinite;stroke-linecap:round;}#m3f71bf64baea6dc9 .edge-animation-fast{stroke-dasharray:9,5!important;stroke-dashoffset:900;animation:dash 20s linear infinite;stroke-linecap:round;}#m3f71bf64baea6dc9 .error-icon{fill:#552222;}#m3f71bf64baea6dc9 .error-text{fill:#552222;stroke:#552222;}#m3f71bf64baea6dc9 .edge-thickness-normal{stroke-width:1px;}#m3f71bf64baea6dc9 .edge-thickness-thick{stroke-width:3.5px;}#m3f71bf64baea6dc9 .edge-pattern-solid{stroke-dasharray:0;}#m3f71bf64baea6dc9 .edge-thickness-invisible{stroke-width:0;fill:none;}#m3f71bf64baea6dc9 .edge-pattern-dashed{stroke-dasharray:3;}#m3f71bf64baea6dc9 .edge-pattern-dotted{stroke-dasharray:2;}#m3f71bf64baea6dc9 .marker{fill:#333333;str